{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415016","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415016","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1041501601:1":{"text":"아야! 또 머리를 부딪쳤어요...","source_cn":"啊哟！又撞到头了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F118844937B2AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:3:1041501601":{"text":"아야! 또 머리를 부딪쳤어요...","source_cn":"啊哟！又撞到头了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9F118844937B2AEE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501602:1":{"text":"네, 손에서 놓치면 바로 이마에 닿아요... 그래도 잎이 부드러워서 다행이에요.","source_cn":"嗯嗯，一个没拿稳，就歪下来撞到额头了……幸好这片叶子很柔软。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3537C7FF1EA931BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501605:1":{"text":"별거 아니네요, 저한테 맡겨주세요! 지금 문제는 잎사귀의 손잡이 부분이 너무 길다는 거예요!","source_cn":"这有什么难的，交给我！问题的核心出在——这片叶子的叶柄...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F9CB8472EA6C071","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501606:1":{"text":"제가 새로 발명한 접이식 잎사귀 구경하러 오세요! 급속 성장 덩굴에 억제제 버튼을 더하면...","source_cn":"来见证我的全新发明伸缩折叠叶吧！只要配上速生藤，再搭配...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD8D848DDEA567F4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501607:1":{"text":"...하, 하지만... 저는 성장과 치유의 힘을 담은 빗방울 마법을 자주 사용하는데요...","source_cn":"……但、但是……我常常使用降雨的魔法，雨水中蕴藏有促进...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x751A49C7D90B067B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501608:1":{"text":"비에 젖으면 억제제가 소용이 없어지잖아요. 그때는... 어떻게 되는 거죠...","source_cn":"一旦淋了雨，抑制剂可能会失效，那之后会……会怎么样呢……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x324319EE5FAA5B2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041501609:1":{"text":"네?! 이, 이런! 그 점은 생각 못 했어요!","source_cn":"什么？！我没想到这一点，可、可恶！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC881178E3ABE3F20","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041501610:1":{"text":"돌아가서 바로 실험해 봐야겠어요. 이번에는 반드시 마법의 영향도 고려할게요!","source_cn":"我现在回去立刻做实验，这次绝对会考虑到魔法的影响！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD5A07342C21498CE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:0:1":{"text":"잎사귀가 너무 큰 거 아니야?","source_cn":"这片叶子太大了吧？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7E880435778F0269","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"잎사귀가 너무 큰 거 아니야?","female":"잎사귀가 너무 큰 거 아니야?","variant_male_record_index":"96119","variant_female_record_index":"96120","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041501603:1":{"text":"음... 제 마법으로는 안 될 거예요...\n치유의 빗방울은 잎사귀에 생기를 계속해서 불어넣어요. 그럼, 잎사귀는 영원히 시들지 않고 금방 딴 것처럼 푸릇푸릇해지죠.","source_cn":"唔……我的魔法大概办不到……\\n疗愈的雨水可以维持它的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x972F17D3F638F209","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041501604:1":{"text":"그 대신 잎사귀가 끊임없이 자라나요... 그래서 지금은 처음 땄을 때보다 몇 배나 커졌어요.","source_cn":"但这样只会让它越长越大……现在它已经比刚摘下来的时候大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08F848A0C5CB7FE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:3:1:2":{"text":"마법으로 잎사귀를 작게 만들 거야?","source_cn":"要用魔法把叶子变小吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xBF8153AA8DDB7CB6","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"마법으로 잎사귀를 작게 만들 거야?","female":"마법으로 잎사귀를 작게 만들 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"96121","variant_female_record_index":"96122","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:伊温":{"text":"휴윈","source":"伊温","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:达米安":{"text":"다미안","source":"达米安","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}